+# Dennis AI Mastering Lab v0.15.10 — Stem Intelligence Diagnostics (TEST)
+
+- Preserve all stereo mastering DSP from v0.15.7/v0.15.9.
+- Stem-only and stereo+stem inspections remain read-only.
+- Add independent activity-window checks for sparse instruments, retaining existing correlation, timing and polarity gates.
+- Distinguish insufficient evidence from a confirmed unsafe stem.
+- Report active fraction and active-signal RMS.
+- Examine short common tail differences with actual authoritative WAV tail samples. Diagnostics never override strict duration gating.
+- Show duration and per-stem evidence details in the app.
+- Side-by-side test app ID: com.dennis.aimasteringlab.test1510.
